ted","passed":false,"violation_count":1,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905806557","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905806557","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2022-07-06","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220706-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-745-641","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220706","date":"2022-07-06","original_code":"745.641","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-07-06","finding":"AP Background check results - Must receive notification prior to allowing subject to be present at your operation: I observed a caregiver at the operation that does not have background check submitted to CLASS.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026436673","violation_type_title":"AP Background check results - Must receive notification prior to allowing subject to be present at your operation (26 TAC §745.641)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220613","date":"2022-06-13","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":7,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905806556","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905806556","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2022-06-13","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220613-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-747-3501-7","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220613","date":"2022-06-13","original_code":"747.3501(7)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-07-06","finding":"Safety - Hinged Lid Storage Containers Safe: I observed a storage container in the outdoor play area that was accessible to children and did not have a hinged lid.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026507333","violation_type_title":"Safety - Hinged Lid Storage Containers Safe (26 TAC §747.3501(7))","topic_label":"Safety hazards"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220613-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-747-4305","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220613","date":"2022-06-13","original_code":"747.4305","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-07-06","finding":"Storage for Individual Belongings: I observed that the storage area for the children was not clearly labled for each child's belongings.","topic":"other","source_record_id":"1026226363","violation_type_title":"Storage for Individual Belongings (26 TAC §747.4305)","topic_label":"Other"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220613-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-747-905","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220613","date":"2022-06-13","original_code":"747.905","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-07-06","finding":"Personnel Records for Household Members Not Used in Child/Caregiver Ratio: While completing the health and safety audit, the operation was unable to provide me with personal records for the directors husband, who lives in the home.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026427112","violation_type_title":"Personnel Records for Household Members Not Used in Child/Caregiver Ratio (26 TAC §747.905)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220613-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-747-2811","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220613","date":"2022-06-13","original_code":"747.2811","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-07-06","finding":"Adequate Lighting During Naptime: I observed an infant during naptime in a dark room that did not have adequate lighting. The door was shut and the infant was alone.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026387125","violation_type_title":"Adequate Lighting During Naptime (26 TAC §747.2811)","topic_label":"Facilities & equipment"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220613-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-745-641","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220613","date":"2022-06-13","original_code":"745.641","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-06-23","finding":"AP Background check results - Must receive notification prior to allowing subject to be present at your operation: As I was completing the walkthrough of the operation, I was told by the director and her husband that their son was living in the home and they showed me his bedroom. I reviewed CLASS, and their son is not currently documented as having a completed background check. He was not present at the time of the inspection and the director stated they would run the checks that day.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026427114","violation_type_title":"AP Background check results - Must receive notification prior to allowing subject to be present at your operation (26 TAC §745.641)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220613-v6","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-747-3203-13","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220613","date":"2022-06-13","original_code":"747.3203(13)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-07-06","finding":"Mark Cleaning Supplies, Toxic Materials; Separate from Food and Inaccessible: I observed that cabinets in the kitchen and bathroom contained cleaning supplies that were accessible to children. I observed that there were no locks on the cabinet doors.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026306552","violation_type_title":"Mark Cleaning Supplies, Toxic Materials; Separate from Food and Inaccessible (26 TAC §747.3203(13))","topic_label":"Safety hazards"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220613-v7","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-747-5003-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1170896-i20220613","date":"2022-06-13","original_code":"747.5003(1)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-06-15","finding":"Emergency Preparedness Plan - Evacuation, Relocation and Sheltering Procedures: While completing the health and safety audit, I observed that the operation did not have a section addressing shelter in place.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026427113","violation_type_title":"Emergency Preparedness Plan - Evacuation, Relocation and Sheltering Procedures (26 TAC §747.5003(1))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"}]}],"geo":{"state":{"code":"TX","name":"Texas"},"county":{"fips":"48085","name":"Collin County"},"zip":"75002","city":"Allen"},"related":{"same_operator":[],"same_operator_total":0,"same_building":[],"same_address_other_authority":[],"nearby":[]}}
